{"slug":"Steal-a-Brainrot-Steal-A-Brainrot-44287","_id":"686c28b55ff8bc43bdd3df26","title":"Script for","game":{"_id":"68313258440874f0e1fb73d9","gameId":109983668079237,"name":"Steal a Brainrot","imageUrl":"/images/sb/rbx-cdcba985adea2b974ef0160869d555f1-0cc2c76910c4.png","placeId":109983668079237},"features":"Custom GUI\n\nDraggable, gold-themed interface with player avatar, custom title, and unified button styles.\n\nPersistent GUI\n\nGUI remains visible and functional even after player death or respawn.\n\nDynamic Notifications\n\nOn-screen messages for activations, deactivations, and status updates.\n\nTeleport Up\n\nInstant 200-stud vertical teleport; activates 40 WalkSpeed; removes roofs.\n\nFall Down\n\nResets player to low height (10 studs Y); restores default WalkSpeed; restores roofs.\n\nToggle Speed Boost\n\nToggles 45 WalkSpeed (ground-only); resets on deactivation/respawn.\n\nToggle Touchy\n\nPlayer continuously zips between 8 relative corners; stops normal movement while active.\n\nToggle Tween Forward\n\nToggles a continuous 30-speed forward dash with a 9-inch lift; velocity-based movement.\n\nHitbox Toggle\n\nExpands world hitboxes to 15x15x15 studs for easier interaction; reverts on toggle off.\n\nRoof Vanishing\n\nMakes roofs and ceilings invisible/non-collidable upon Teleport Up.\n\nRoof Restoration\n\nRestores roofs and ceilings to normal state upon Fall Down.\n\nESP\n\nHighlights other players with name/avatar display.","tags":["exploit","stealabrainrot","script","works"],"script":"loadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://pastefy.app/KUMRYHSv/raw\",true))()","owner":{"_id":"684759b1df5a1e3916a53694","username":"velocityc0re","verified":false,"profilePicture":"/images/photo/684759b1df5a1e3916a53694-1750965391815.png","status":"offline","id":"684759b1df5a1e3916a53694","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.scripts","tier":10}},"verified":false,"views":46286,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","image":"/images/sb/10998